<title>USA: Payless ShoeSource Inc Q4 Feb 1 profit.</title>
<headline>Payless ShoeSource Inc Q4 Feb 1 profit.</headline>
<dateline>TOPEKA, Kan. 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $0.38     loss	 $0.80</p>
<p> Net     profit	  15,100     loss	32,400</p>
<p> Revs		     523,000		  551,600</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  40,200		   40,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Year-ago Q4 results after $71.8 million pretax, or $43.5 million after tax, write-off for restructuring and store closing costs.  </p>
<p>Current Q4 after $2.2 million in spin-off costs.</p>
<p>Year-ago Q4 and full-year shares outstanding based on number of Payless shares issued and outstanding as of May 4, 1996, the date it was spun off from May Department Stores Co.</p>
<p>		     YEAR</p>
<p> Shr     profit	   $2.68   profit	 $1.34</p>
<p> Net     profit	 107,700   profit	54,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,333,700		2,330,300</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  40,200		   40,400</p>
<p>(All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Current fiscal year results after $12.6 million in spin-off costs.</p>
<p>Year-ago fiscal year results includes $43.5 million in after-tax restructuring and store closing costs.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
